2 CONT
2 CONT If he and his descendants look here. Theory: Mikkel Nielsen (or Nilsen) Barfod ?. Has possibly been married the second time with a Skiernow, which according to one theory is the mother of the son Niels. about 1360 (ancestor of the
2 CONC  Barfod genus?).
2 CONT
2 CONT Theory: A sister Guldbrand. A brother Olof - lived in 1380, married a daughter of a baron of Talgö (ancestor of the Skancke genus (Norway)?). A brother Lafrans.
2 CONT
2 CONT A brother Peder - lived in 1410 (ancestor of the Skuncke genus (Sweden)?).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Brother Ture.
2 CONT
2 CONT A brother Thord - lived in 1366 read more
2 CONT
2 CONT Obs! Det mangler kilder for at han skulle være sønn av Nils Schancke!! Nej, det er ikke rigtigt. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skanke_(noble_family) https://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skanke http://www.skankeforeningen.no/ http://www.s
