2 CONC  to the church in Linköping's farm in Hogstad with all belongings and buildings1 and releases all his troops. To the prostitute Nils in Högby, he donates his black tunic with surkot and hood, to his nephew N, his lined hoodie, to 
2 CONC his son Birger as the "schooling" the value of his own armor, since it was sold by the testament dean Dean Jng (e / mouth /?). His other weapons are to be distributed to his wife, between his friends, Beno Byllasson, Hakvin Rød, N
2 CONC ils Krok, Yandus, Torkil, Peter Långe and Toke, in addition to a horse, his sword and helmet, which he gives to Yandus. In order to get rid of his crusade promise he dedicates two silver beads and a silver cannon, which is found a
2 CONC t the goldsmith Tideman in Söderköping. In addition, he pays a lot of goods to solve a number of money requirements for individuals and institutions. Witnesses are his wife Kristina, the linking schnapps Svennung and Birger, magic
2 CONC ian Otto, brother Knut from Söderköping and his priest Nils, who also sealed together with the issuer and the linköping chapter.
2 CONT
