2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Sigge Guttormsson, till Ljuna and Kristina Birgersdotter (Bjälboätten) 
2 CONT * Kristina Birgersdotter's will from 1285 is preserved. As a sealer of the mother's will, there are two daughters from an early marriage - Margareta and Helena Kristinadotter who should most likely have been adults at this time. (
2 CONC Source: Bo Theutenberg - Folk kings and crusaders)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK No: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?ValdSortering=DatumStigande&PageSize=20&Sokord=Kristina&EndastDigitaliserat=False&FacettLimits=IfjiTQ%3A0&AvanceradSok=True&page=14&postid=sdhk_1204&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab
