2 CONC LD Palsdatter .  m secondly (after 15 Jun 1184) as her second husband, CECILIA Sigurdsdotter, divorced wife of FOLKVID Lagmand in Värmland, illegitimate daughter of SIGURD Haraldsson "Mund" Joint King of Norway & his mistress --- 
2 CONC (-1185).  The Saga of King Sverre records that King Sverre arranged the marriage of "his sister Cecilia" to "Bard Guthormsson of Rein"[243], dated from the context to just after the death of King Magnus [15 Jun 1184].  m thirdly R
2 CONC AGNDID Erlingsdotter . 
