2 CONT
2 CONT (1)  g. Eldrid, the daughter of Blindheim.
2 CONT
2 CONT (2)  g,1150, Sigrid Torkjellsdatter, d. after 1150.
2 CONT
2 CONT (3) g. Ingeborg's daughter Aure, F. Aure in the Sykulven, Møre og Romsdal.
2 CONT
2 CONT (4) g. Berljot on reindeer. Guttorm died in 1150.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 
2 CONT (1) ''' Eldrid Jonsdatter Smør, av Blindheim;''' Guttorm Åsolvsson of Rein was one of the loins men after Harald Gille Magnussons death in 1136 who supported his son Sigurd mouth Haraldsson. He was Sigurd Munn's body guard. Guttor
2 CONC m Åsolvsson of Rein had a brother Ottar Bale Åsulvsson, who was a mighty chieftain in Mid-Norway. Guttorm's wife, Eldrid was a daughter of Jon Smørbjalte.
2 CONT
