1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Havel Eriksen Lonnum was born in Lonnum, Biri, Oppland, Norway, in 1682. He died in Lonnum, Biri, Oppland, Norway, in 1731 at the age of 49. He married Ingeborg Larsdatter Jessnes.  They had four children: Ole Havelsen, Jens Havel
2 CONC sen, Marte Havelsdatter and Lars Havelsen. Then Havel Eriksen married Kari Helgerud. They had three children: Johannes Havelsen, Marit Havelsdatter and Bersvend Havelsen.
