1 NOTE Baard Jarl of Skule abt 1200:  was probably descendant of Baard the Viking
2 CONT who sacked Tours (France) in 903.  Baard Jarl was leader of the Norwegians
2 CONT in their fight with the Danes in Northern Ireland in 878.  ("History of
2 CONT the Norwegian People, page 48.)
1 NOTE Baard er nevnt i slaget ved Nordnes 1181.
1 NOTE     * RESIDENCE: Nevnt 1181 (slaget ved Nordnes)
