2 CONT * '''Dating: 1359 July 30, of Issue: Stensö'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Holmger Torkelsson announces that he and his brother the '''knight Magnus Torkelsson''' and several others' consent as a morning gift have given his wife Sigrid Karlsdotter 13 ½ öresland land in Norrlänna in Länna parish in Åkers 
2 CONC district and 1 land land in Vävelsta in Husby-Oppunda parish and a mill in Djupvik with two villagers in (Ö.) Husby (now in Kvarsebo) parish in Östkinds district. If they have children, the morning gift should be counted as the ch
2 CONC ildren's mothers. If Sigrid dies (childless) before Holmger, the morning present returns to him. If Holmger dies first, the morning present will be Sigrids. Advice has been obtained from Mr. Magnus Torkelsson and Harald Ernilsson 
2 CONC and Karl Tuveson. - https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/7574.pdf
