1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Jens Pedersen was supervisor at Rui in Flatdal. (He calls Flatin Jens Pedersen Skandrup in the village register.) Magdalene was the daughter of the priest Zacharias Jonsen Schanke b. 1601 d. 1689. (Flatin - Seljord volume II page 
2 CONC 490)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jens Pedersen died in 1692, and Magdalene was remarried to Gunleik Nikulsen. There was a shift after Gunleik at Rui in 1729.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jens Pedersen was in charge of Rui in Flatdal. (He calls Flatin in the village book Jens Pedersen Skandrup.) Magdalene was the daughter of the priest Zacharias Jonsen Schanke b. 1601 d. 1689. (Flatin - Seljord volume II page 490)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jens Pedersen died in 1692, and Magdalene remarried Gunleik Nikulsen. There was a change after Gunleik at Rui in 1729.
2 CONT
