1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:kb_read?idx_kildeid=7962&idx_id=7962&uid=ny&idx_side=-184
2 CONT
2 CONT https://gamlegjerpen.no/Kirkeb/Seljord/SeljordPrester.htm.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the chaplain of Zacharias and took over as priest after his father-in-law died. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Mikkelsen Wulf 18 Nov 1635 - 5 Feb 1713
2 CONT
2 CONT     RESIDENCE: Kapellan i Seljord hos svigerfar
2 CONT     OCCUPATION: Sogneprest i Seljord
2 CONT     BIRTH: 18 Nov 1635, Königsberg, Tyskland ? (neppe Kongsberg)
2 CONT     BAPTISM: (foreldre bosatt i Skien)
2 CONT     DEATH: 5 Feb 1713, Seljord 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Michelson Wulf, b. 1635, d. 1713, married in Seljord on 18 Feb 1672 Maria Zachariasdtr Schanche, b. 1655, d. 1736, dtr of Pastor Zacharias Jonson Schanche & his second wife, Sarka Jansdtr (Groll?). Daniel M. Wulf was assist
2 CONC ant pastor is Seljord when he married Maria, then took over the ministry after Pastor Schanche died.
2 CONT
2 CONT Studied at Roskilde Copenhagen University
2 CONT
2 CONT Source  Roger de Robelin "Skanke Atten"
