1 NAME Martinus Olai /Olofsson/
2 GIVN Martinus Olai
2 SURN Olofsson
2 _MARNM Brunnerus
2 NICK Martin Brunnerus
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 SEP 1627
2 PLAC Harmånger
